.</i> and <i>Pass.</i>), , . </div><div>send up, produce, <span class=\"note\"><span class=\"gr\">ὅσα πέμπει βιόδωρος αἶα</span></span> (lyr.). </div><div class=\"sense\"><i>Med.</i>, <span class=\"gr\">πέμπεσθαί τινα</span>send for one, , ubiv. Sch.; <span class=\"gr\">τί χρῆμ' ἐπέμψω τὸν ἐμὸν ἐκ δόμων πόδα</span>; . </div><div>send in one's own service or cause to be sent, , .</div>","inflection":"πέμπω, Ep. inf. -έμεναι, -έμεν, , : Ion. impf.","dict":"lsj"},"grc:verb:πέμπει":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμπει","lemma":"πέμπει","pos":"verb","gloss":"inflection of πέμπω (pémpō):","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμπων":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμπων","lemma":"πέμπων","pos":"verb","gloss":"present active participle of πέμπω (pémpō)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμπουσι":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμπουσι","lemma":"πέμπουσι","pos":"verb","gloss":"third-person plural present active indicative of πέμπω (pémpō)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμψας":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμψας","lemma":"πέμψας","pos":"verb","gloss":"aorist active participle of πέμπω (pémpō)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμψαντας":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμψαντας","lemma":"πέμψαντας","pos":"verb","gloss":"masculine accusative plural of πέμψᾱς (pémpsās)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμψαντες":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμψαντες","lemma":"πέμψαντες","pos":"verb","gloss":"masculine nominative/vocative plural of πέμψᾱς (pémpsās)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμπειν":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμπειν","lemma":"πέμπειν","pos":"verb","gloss":"present active infinitive of πέμπω (pémpō)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πέμψει":{"id":"grc:verb:πέμψει","lemma":"πέμψει","pos":"verb","gloss":"third-person singular future active indicative of πέμπω (pémpō)","src":"wiktionary","dict":"wiktionary"},"grc:verb:πεμπάζω":{"id":"grc:verb:πεμπάζω","lemma":"πεμπάζω","pos":"verb","gloss":"count on the five fingers","src":"lsj","senses":["count on 